n}</script></a></div></div></div><div fs-slider-element=\"scrollbar\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar\"><div fs-slider-element=\"scrollbar-drag\" class=\"fs-slider-gallery_scrollbar_drag\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><div><section class=\"services\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div><div data-w-id=\"983862a7-3688-6e3b-afeb-1962d292774b\" class=\"header-subservices\"><div class=\"heading-deco\">What do we do!</div><h2 class=\"blue\">Pool Remodeling &amp; Full Renovation Services in Florida</h2><p>We remodel and renovate pools across North &amp; South Florida, upgrading finishes, equipment, and features for safety and efficiency.</p></div></div><div class=\"block-page-service\"><div class=\"svc-detalle\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--derecha\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-064/pool-shell-repair-spa-bond-beam-rebuild.avif\" alt=\"Spa with a newly poured concrete bond beam and exposed plumbing beside a drained pool, structural pool repair in Florida\" width=\"1200\" height=\"670\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Shell &amp; Structural Restoration</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">A complete renovation starts below the surface. We assess the shell, plumbing and safety barrier first; where the structure needs it, the remodel rebuilds the gunite and brings plumbing and barriers up to current Florida Building Code. Every finish and fixture we install rides on that structure.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/complete-pool-renovation/iconremodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Complete Pool Renovation</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Full pool renovations designed to modernize appearance, improve functionality, and extend the life of your pool.</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/structural-pool-repairs/icon-5remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Structural Pool Repairs</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Shell and structural work carried out as part of a complete renovation, when the assessment calls for it.</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--izquierda\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-9/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"Remodeled pool with a raised spa against a modern Florida home\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Resurfacing, Tile &amp; Coping</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">We strip the old interior down to sound gunite and apply plaster, quartz, or pebble finishes rated for Florida sun and salt systems. We replace waterline tile and coping in the same pass, sealing the bond beam and leaving an edge that stays cool underfoot.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-resurfacing-finishes/icon-1remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Pool Resurfacing &amp; Finishes</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Pool resurfacing solutions including plaster, quartz, and pebble finishes for durability and style.</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/tile-coping-replacement/icon-2remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Tile &amp; Coping Replacement</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Tile and coping upgrades that enhance pool safety, aesthetics, and long-term structural protection.</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--derecha\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Remodeled pool with a sun shelf and loungers\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Equipment, Automation &amp; LED Lighting</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">Salt air and year-round run times are hard on pool equipment, so a complete remodel is the moment to replace it as one system: variable-speed pumps, filters, heaters and salt cells sized to the renovated pool, and low-voltage LED in place of incandescent fixtures. New wiring lands on GFCI-protected circuits bonded to the deck grid, as code requires.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-equipment-upgrades/icon-3remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Pool Equipment Upgrades</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Pumps, filtration, heaters and automation replaced as one system within a complete remodel.</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/led-pool-lighting-systems/icon-4remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">LED Pool Lighting Systems</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Energy-efficient LED pool lighting designed to enhance visibility, ambiance, and nighttime safety.</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"svc-detalle__fila svc-detalle__fila--izquierda\"><img class=\"svc-detalle__foto\" src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-2/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-02.jpg\" alt=\"Aerial view of a remodeled pool with a pergola and palms\" width=\"1250\" height=\"946\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__cuerpo\"><h3 class=\"svc-detalle__tit\">Pool Decks &amp; Spa Integration</h3><p class=\"svc-detalle__intro\">A renovated pool beside a cracked, slick deck still looks tired. We resurface decks with textured, UV-stable coatings or pavers that stay walkable in South Florida heat, and we tie a new or remodeled spa into the pool so both share one plumbing and heating system.</p><ul class=\"svc-detalle__lista\"><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-deck-hardscape-remodeling/icon-6remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Pool Deck Resurfacing</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Pool deck resurfacing services that improve safety, appearance, and outdoor functionality.</div></div></div></li><li class=\"svc-detalle__item\" data-w-id=\"f2721b05-6e5e-044b-b7c9-7a2a8bd783b4\"><div class=\"svc-detalle__caja\"><img src=\"/images/subservices/pool-finishes-interior-surface-installation/icon-7remodeling.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-subservice\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><h4 class=\"heading-2\">Spa Remodeling &amp; Integration</h4><div class=\"paragraph-mini\">Spa remodeling and integration services that complement pool renovations for added comfort.</div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"before-after-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div class=\"before-after-content\"><div fb-before-after-start=\"50\" fb-before-after=\"true\" fb-before-after-direction=\"horizontal\" class=\"bas-wrapper\"><img alt=\"Before: screened pool with a painted concrete deck, brick coping and dark tile, ahead of a pool remodel in Florida\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1280.avif\" class=\"bas-image-before\" srcset=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-640.avif 640w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-960.avif 960w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1280.avif 1280w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1600.avif 1600w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-before-screened-pool-brick-coping-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 56vw, 100vw\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\"><img fb-before-after-side=\"after\" alt=\"After: the same pool with blue glass waterline tile and an ivory travertine deck, pool renovation in Florida\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1280.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"bas-image-after-h\" srcset=\"/images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-640.avif 640w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-960.avif 960w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1280.avif 1280w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1600.avif 1600w, /images/obra/obra-048/pool-remodeling-after-glass-tile-travertine-deck-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 992px) 56vw, 100vw\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\"><div fb-before-after-handle=\"true\" class=\"bas-handle-h\"><div class=\"bas-icon-reg